{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ locked" : {
      "comment" : "Swap on Stellar, after the XLM balance under 'You Pay': how much of it Stellar keeps in the account (its minimum balance), which can't be swapped. The value is an amount of XLM (1.5)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ bloqueados"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ bloqués"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 잠김"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balance %@ XLM, of which %@ XLM is locked as Stellar's minimum balance" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: the XLM balance under Swap's 'You Pay' on Stellar. The values are amounts of XLM: the balance, then the part Stellar keeps in the account as its minimum balance. Stellar and XLM are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saldo de %1$@ XLM, de los cuales %2$@ XLM están bloqueados como saldo mínimo de Stellar"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solde de %1$@ XLM, dont %2$@ XLM bloqués comme solde minimum de Stellar"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "잔액 %1$@ XLM 중 %2$@ XLM은 Stellar 최소 잔액으로 잠겨 있어요"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "余额 %1$@ XLM，其中 %2$@ XLM 作为 Stellar 最低余额被锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enabling %@ holds %@ XLM. It's part of this review." : {
      "comment" : "Swap on Stellar, under 'You Receive', when the account hasn't enabled the asset it buys (a Stellar trustline): enabling it is a step of the same review and keeps this much of the account's XLM. The values are the asset's code (USDC) and an amount of XLM (0.5). XLM is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activar %1$@ retiene %2$@ XLM. Forma parte de esta revisión."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activer %1$@ bloque %2$@ XLM. Cela fait partie de ce récapitulatif."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@을(를) 활성화하면 %2$@ XLM이 보관돼요. 이번 검토에 포함돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用 %1$@ 会占用 %2$@ XLM，已包含在本次确认中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This coin trades on its Launch page until it graduates." : {
      "comment" : "Swap on Stellar, when one side is a DyorHQ coin still on its launchpad's curve: no venue can swap it yet, it trades on its Launch page",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta moneda se opera en su página de lanzamiento hasta que se gradúe."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce jeton s'échange sur sa page de lancement jusqu'à ce qu'il soit gradué."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 코인은 졸업할 때까지 런칭 페이지에서 거래돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该币毕业前在其发射页面交易。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}